
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
        <h1>What we build, and what it costs.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Five categories cover almost everything a small business needs. Starting prices show roughly where a project lands.</p>
        <p class="callout"><strong>Every project starts with a R500 deposit</strong> — fully refundable until you approve the quote, then credited toward your final price. You see an estimate first, and a fixed quote before any work begins.</p>
        <nav class="service-nav" aria-label="Jump to a service" style="justify-content:flex-start">
          <a href="#websites">Websites · from R1,000</a>
          <a href="#dashboards">Dashboards · from R2,000</a>
          <a href="#automation">Automation · from R2,000</a>
          <a href="#ai">AI · from R3,500</a>
          <a href="#software">Custom Software · from R4,500</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WEBSITES -->
    <section class="service" id="websites" aria-labelledby="websitesTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="websitesTitle">Websites</h2>
          <p class="lead">Fast, professional websites built around what you want visitors to do — call, WhatsApp, book or buy.</p>
          <ul class="price-list" style="margin:0.8rem 0 0.4rem">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Quick Website<small>One page, WhatsApp, Maps, basic SEO · ~1 day</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business Website<small>4–5 pages, custom layout, form, gallery · ~1–2 days</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Custom Website<small>Booking, ecommerce, portals, accounts, integrations</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Business websites</li><li>Landing pages</li><li>Portfolio websites</li><li>Service websites</li><li>Restaurant websites</li><li>Booking websites</li><li>Ecommerce</li><li>Website integrations</li><li>Redesigns</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You need a professional presence online, fast and affordably.</li>
            <li>Your current site is slow, dated or hard to update.</li>
            <li>You want enquiries by inbox or WhatsApp, not a dead "contact us" page.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.9rem">Minor changes to an existing site from R250.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card">
            <h4>Starting price</h4>
            <span class="price"><small>From</small>R1,000</span>
            <p class="small muted">Target timeframes once content is supplied, not guaranteed dates.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>See it live</h4><p>Try the <a class="inline-link" href="demos#booking">booking</a> and <a class="inline-link" href="demos#quote-calculator">quote</a> demos — the kind of thing a site can include.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Website" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a website project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- DASHBOARDS -->
    <section class="service section--tint" id="dashboards" aria-labelledby="dashboardsTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="dashboardsTitle">Dashboards</h2>
          <p class="lead">Your spreadsheets and systems, turned into one screen you can actually read.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Business dashboards</li><li>Sales dashboards</li><li>Financial dashboards</li><li>Project dashboards</li><li>Reporting dashboards</li><li>Excel / CSV dashboards</li><li>Management dashboards</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Someone rebuilds the same report every week or month.</li>
            <li>Your data lives across spreadsheets that never quite agree.</li>
            <li>You want to see how the business is doing at a glance.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R2,000</span><p class="small muted">Depends on how many data sources are involved and how much cleaning they need.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Bring your data</h4><p>Excel, CSV or an export is enough to start. You can attach a sample file in the Project Builder.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Dashboard" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a dashboard project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AUTOMATION -->
    <section class="service" id="automation" aria-labelledby="automationTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 4v5h5"/><path d="M20 20v-5h-5"/><path d="M4.5 9A8 8 0 0 1 19 7"/><path d="M19.5 15A8 8 0 0 1 5 17"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="automationTitle">Automation</h2>
          <p class="lead">Repetitive manual work, handled for you — the same steps, done automatically.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Automated reports</li><li>Form → database workflows</li><li>Email automation</li><li>Document generation</li><li>Data processing</li><li>Repetitive admin</li><li>Business process automation</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Information gets copied between systems by hand.</li>
            <li>Customers wait for confirmations, quotes or standard documents.</li>
            <li>A process only works because one person remembers the steps.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R2,000</span><p class="small muted">Single-workflow automations sit near the start; multi-system integrations quoted on scope.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Quick win</h4><p>Automations are often the fastest way to get real time back. Show us the process and we'll estimate it.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Automation" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start an automation project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- AI -->
    <section class="service section--tint" id="ai" aria-labelledby="aiTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l1.8 5.2L19 10l-5.2 1.8L12 17l-1.8-5.2L5 10l5.2-1.8z"/><path d="M19 17l.8 2.2L22 20l-2.2.8L19 23l-.8-2.2L16 20l2.2-.8z"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="aiTitle">AI Integrations</h2>
          <p class="lead">Practical AI added to a real process — never AI for its own sake.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>AI assistants</li><li>Business knowledge assistants</li><li>Document Q&amp;A</li><li>AI-powered search</li><li>AI content generation</li><li>AI classification</li><li>AI customer support</li><li>AI workflow automation</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>The same questions get asked repeatedly, with answers written down somewhere.</li>
            <li>People spend time reading, sorting or summarising documents.</li>
            <li>You want AI but need someone to find where it actually helps.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R3,500</span><p class="small muted">Plus AI/API usage, quoted separately — never bundled into a fixed price, so you always know the running cost.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Try it first</h4><p>The <a class="inline-link" href="demos#ai-assistant">Ask BuildRight demo</a> shows how a knowledge assistant feels.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=AI" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start an AI project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CUSTOM SOFTWARE -->
    <section class="service" id="software" aria-labelledby="softwareTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/><path d="M16 6l6 6-6 6"/><path d="M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="softwareTitle">Custom Software</h2>
          <p class="lead">When off-the-shelf doesn't fit, we build the tool that works your way — nothing you don't need.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Calculators</li><li>Quote generators</li><li>Booking systems</li><li>Customer trackers</li><li>Job management</li><li>Stock management</li><li>CRM-style systems</li><li>Client portals</li><li>Internal tools</li><li>Custom web apps</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You pay for software that does only part of what you need.</li>
            <li>You have an idea for an app but don't know where to start.</li>
            <li>The business has outgrown Excel, WhatsApp and paper.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R4,500</span><p class="small muted">Smaller tools start here; larger applications quoted individually after we understand the scope.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Start small</h4><p>We build the smallest useful version first, then grow it in quoted steps as it proves itself.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Custom%20Tool" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a software project</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="unsureTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Not sure which one you need?</span>
        <h2 id="unsureTitle">You don't have to pick a category.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:1rem auto 1.6rem">Most real projects sit between two of these — a website with a booking system, a dashboard fed by an automation. Just describe the problem in the Project Builder and we'll work out the simplest solution.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
          <a href="demos" class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--large">Try the demos</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Not ready to commit? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-mockup-open>Get a free mockup</button> of your idea first — free, no obligation.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

